==Trivia==
*They have played the most rounds at an international VALORANT tournament (554) which was also their first LAN appearence. ([[VCT/2022/Stage_2/Masters|VCT: Stage 2 Masters - Copenhagen]])<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.vlr.gg/event/stats/1014/valorant-champions-tour-stage-2-masters-copenhagen|title=Valorant Champions Tour Stage 2: Masters Copenhagen|date=2022-07-24|author=[[VLR.GG]]}}</ref>
*They are the second winners of an international event of the 2022 VALORANT Champions Tour season, and the fifth team to win an international event overall. <ref> {{cite web|url=https://www.oneesports.gg/valorant/funplus-phoenix-win-masters-copenhagen/|title=FunPlus Phoenix crowned champions of Masters Copenhagen after incredible clutch performances|date=2022-07-25|author=[[ONE Esports]]}}</ref>
*They are the first organization to qualify for a global event in 2 different regions (EMEA, China).

